{
  "$schema": "./dispositions.schema.md",
  "_doc": [
    "Every slot declared by a component must either be governed by a family in",
    "families.css, or appear here with an explicit disposition. The build gate",
    "(scripts/check-design-coverage.mjs) fails otherwise.",
    "",
    "structural      \u2014 carries no paint of its own (portal, root, collection).",
    "alias           \u2014 painted through another contract; `of` names it. `conditional`",
    "                  marks an alias that only holds for some compositions.",
    "adapter         \u2014 treated outside the families; `owner` and `rule` say where.",
    "shape-exception \u2014 deliberately keeps a shape the presets do not change.",
    "unresolved      \u2014 painted, no treatment yet. This is DEBT, kept visible on",
    "                  purpose. The exact set is recorded in \"unresolvedSlots\";",
    "                  the gate fails on any slot newly parked here, so new debt",
    "                  cannot hide among the old."
  ],
